{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"fb6ed444ec59cd570737d6ba1c2260ccfce59cc81874f443d44a1863994820f5"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:837646e125458f64babd79faf6f602b7e49a1f2f3013bad825ae2532c3d6fc96","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Yes, both of them achieved significant milestones that advanced their respective careers.","evidence":"[D20:1 | 6:03 pm on 5 September, 2022] Nate: Hey Joanna! Long time no talk. So much has happened. Look how cute they are! Hanging with them has been a big help, especially recently. Speaking of which, I just had a letdown in a video game tourney - I didn't do too great, even though I tried. It was a setback, but I'm trying to stay positive.\n[D21:1 | 1:43 pm on 14 September, 2022] Joanna: Hey Nate, long time no see! My laptop crashed last week and I lost all my work - super frustrating! As a writer, my laptop is like half of my lifeline so losing all progress was like a major blow.","itemId":"urn:uuid:439280ed-8ecd-5e72-b5e4-f36415b8ec20","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c6aaefb88256c28c943574ce9f7d7f172146b187b7f6c58b642a27a18232d722","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Was the first half of September 2022 a good month career-wise for Nate and Joanna? Answer yes or no.","referenceAnswer":"No; because both of them faced setbacks in their career","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c6aaefb88256c28c943574ce9f7d7f172146b187b7f6c58b642a27a18232d722"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}